  "description": "Colga puts a play tower, a balance beam and a swing set in one line. Children climb the wall or the panels to the tower, cross a bridge and pick the green slide or the blue one. Others wait their turn at the swing set on one end. Colga is meant for 30 to 35 children. Its product area is 33'2\" x 21'5\" and the safe play area is 39'2\" x 27'5\", so it needs a long open patch such as a school ground or a park lawn. Strength, team building, hand and eye coordination and concentration are the skills it is listed for. It is a Woody series piece in mixed colours. The 3-year warranty covers galvanised pipe, roto-moulded slides, composite laminates and play rope. Tell us your ground size and the ages you expect.",
